WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.923
Unit fifteen. Alcohol and Young People!

2
00:00:04.895 --> 00:00:08.542
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:11.872
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:16.039
Today we learn about Alcohol and Young People. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:20.647
Alcohol. Say it with me. Alcohol!

6
00:00:24.154 --> 00:00:27.321
Brain. Say it with me. Brain!

7
00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.126
Risk. Say it with me. Risk!

8
00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:41.143
Accident. Say it with me. Accident!

9
00:00:44.663 --> 00:00:48.296
Decision. Say it with me. Decision!

10
00:00:51.795 --> 00:00:55.378
Refuse. Say it with me. Refuse!

11
00:00:58.882 --> 00:01:02.215
Law. Say it with me. Law!

12
00:01:05.717 --> 00:01:08.867
Health. Say it with me. Health!

13
00:01:12.357 --> 00:01:23.910
Alcohol affects the brain and slows reactions, which raises the risk of an accident. Young brains are still growing, so alcohol is especially harmful. I can refuse and make a healthy decision.

14
00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:25.202
I can do that too!

15
00:01:26.497 --> 00:01:31.659
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.709 --> 00:01:32.859
Risk!

17
00:01:33.674 --> 00:01:38.968
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.017 --> 00:01:40.168
Law!

19
00:01:41.065 --> 00:01:47.911
Did you know? The brain keeps developing until the mid-twenties, so alcohol can harm young people more!

20
00:01:47.961 --> 00:01:49.867
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:58.584
Think and answer. How could you say no if someone offers you alcohol?

22
00:01:58.634 --> 00:01:59.784
Great answer!

23
00:02:00.995 --> 00:02:06.047
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.097 --> 00:02:08.805
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

